SELECT 'проектных видов не объявлено ни одного: чем закрыта фаза проектирования — неизвестно' AS detail WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM project_phase_artifact a JOIN phase p ON p.id = a.phase_id WHERE a.project_id = $1 AND p.gate = 'G2') AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM project_documents d WHERE d.project_id = $1 AND d.entity_kind IN ('design-view','data-model')) UNION ALL SELECT a.artifact || ' — ' || CASE WHEN a.we_have = '' THEN 'нечем закрыт' ELSE 'состояние: ' || a.state END FROM project_phase_artifact a JOIN phase p ON p.id = a.phase_id WHERE a.project_id = $1 AND p.gate = 'G2' AND (a.we_have = '' OR a.state NOT LIKE '✅%') UNION ALL SELECT d.entity_kind || ' ' || d.entity_name || ' — вид пуст' FROM project_documents d WHERE d.project_id = $1 AND d.entity_kind IN ('design-view','data-model') AND length(d.content) < 400 ORDER BY 1
